Z||000000||fropuff||02-22-2001||12:46 PM||||Hey, I've been looking for some Impala SS lookalike wheels for my GT, and I found some, with the help of slammedfiero (thanks!)  Anyway, if you want to see them, they're at:  <A HREF="http://www.jdwheels.com/images/ROH%20ZR6.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jdwheels.com/images/ROH%20ZR6.jpg</A>   Information on them is at:  <A HREF="http://www.jdwheels.com/roh_zr6.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jdwheels.com/roh_zr6.htm</A>   I emailed the company to see if they have the correct bolt pattern.  I'm thinking of going with 16x7s for the front; and 17x8.5s for the rear, if they will fit.  Will they?  Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Alex4mula||02-22-2001||01:50 PM||||They may fit but the FWD version probably will look very different. Impalas are RWD cars and offsets are not similar. Make sure you see them before buying so you are not disappointed. TireRack.com & Tire.com have similar designs. Check them out. Shipping is around $60-$70 for a set of wheels & tires.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fropuff||02-22-2001||04:35 PM||||Thanks for the help, but the company replied and said that they don't carry this brand with the 5x100 bolt pattern.  Looks like I'm going to have to keep the originals.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Jim Keyton||02-22-2001||10:20 PM||||I got a set of ROH ZS, 17x7.5, 5x100, 40mm offset from JD Wheels last summer. These wheels do not have the deep dish look of the ZS wheels shown on their site, do to the high offset. It's more of a soft rolled look. I'm using 215/45 and 245/45 tires. These are really good looking wheels, I'm always having someone asking what kind they are and where I got them. They are on an 88 GT, with one coil cut off front springs, and there is no rubbing.||||reg||1
Z||000004||fropuff||02-26-2001||04:55 PM||||I missed out and the ROH company quit making the ZR6 wheels for the 5x100 offset a while ago.  I did, however, find some wheels that I really like as well.  If you don't mind, could you please visit the page and give me some information on these wheels.  Thanks.<P>- <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lowered88gt.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lowered88gt.jpg</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||fropuff||02-27-2001||04:25 PM||||Anyone?  I tried asking the lady at the ROH store, and she won't tell me.  Must not be the kind of wheels they sell.  Thanks.||||reg||1
